Here is a script, and a pattern beside it:

for NAME in $(ls *.go); do
    COUNT=$(grep -c "func" "$NAME")
    echo "$NAME has $COUNT"
done

^\\s*(func|type)\\s+\\w{3,12}\\(

That is one call of every kind the harness knows how to measure.
